WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.855 --> 00:00:12.896
arrived at Roxy's house.

2
00:00:12.916 --> 00:00:16.639
"Hi, Terrell," Roxy's mom said.

3
00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:19.841
"Roxy is on a Rocket Girl mission.

4
00:00:20.281 --> 00:00:22.283
She'll be home in—" Whoosh!

5
00:00:22.843 --> 00:00:24.725
Roxy shot into the house like a rocket.

6
00:00:25.345 --> 00:00:27.026
A framed picture swung wildly.

7
00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:28.968
Her mom caught it.

8
00:00:30.264 --> 00:00:32.846
"No flying in the house, Roxy!"

9
00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.168
"Oops! Sorry, Mom."

10
00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:37.650
Roxy's dad arrived with pizza.

11
00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:40.873
Everyone sat down to eat.

12
00:00:40.893 --> 00:00:44.436
"What did Rocket Girl do this afternoon?"

13
00:00:44.776 --> 00:00:45.777
Roxy's dad asked.

14
00:00:46.878 --> 00:00:47.898
Roxy rolled her eyes.

15
00:00:48.459 --> 00:00:49.940
This was her dad's favorite joke.

16
00:00:50.861 --> 00:00:53.003
He pretended Rocket Girl was someone Roxy knew.

17
00:00:53.603 --> 00:00:55.565
Of course, he knew she was Rocket Girl.

18
00:00:55.585 --> 00:00:59.588
"So?" Her dad handed out slices of pizza.

19
00:01:00.108 --> 00:01:01.668
"Did she fight the giant skunk?"

20
00:01:02.689 --> 00:01:03.629
"What giant skunk?"

21
00:01:03.869 --> 00:01:04.589
Roxy asked.

22
00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:09.431
"Somebody saw a giant skunk in Metro City," Terrell said.

23
00:01:10.071 --> 00:01:11.051
He took a bite of pizza.

24
00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:14.572
"I didn't hear about that," Roxy said.

25
00:01:14.592 --> 00:01:17.353
"I was busy talking to the Mighty Man actor.

26
00:01:17.893 --> 00:01:19.093
He can shoot slime now."

27
00:01:19.113 --> 00:01:22.434
"Wow!" Roxy's mom said.

28
00:01:23.274 --> 00:01:24.094
Terrell shrugged.

29
00:01:24.114 --> 00:01:28.055
"You're still the best superhero in Metro City, Roxy."

30
00:01:28.896 --> 00:01:29.736
Roxy smiled.

31
00:01:30.328 --> 00:01:31.088
"Thanks, Terrell.

32
00:01:31.489 --> 00:01:32.229
I think you're right.

33
00:01:32.769 --> 00:01:35.110
The actor made a big mess at Metro Mart.

34
00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:37.671
I might have to give him superhero lessons."

35
00:01:38.712 --> 00:01:39.572
Her dad chuckled.

36
00:01:39.592 --> 00:01:42.973
"You mean Rocket Girl might have to give him lessons."

37
00:01:44.054 --> 00:01:45.354
Roxy rolled her eyes again.

38
00:01:46.015 --> 00:01:47.615
Just then Terrell bumped his glass.

39
00:01:49.296 --> 00:01:50.696
Roxy grabbed it.

40
00:01:50.736 --> 00:01:53.758
Crack! She accidentally used her super strength.

41
00:01:54.918 --> 00:01:56.699
"Sorry!" Roxy cried.

42
00:01:56.719 --> 00:01:58.900
"It's okay," her dad said.

43
00:01:59.664 --> 00:02:03.266
"We're used to it," Roxy's mom said with a smile.

44
00:02:03.286 --> 00:02:08.549
"I remember when you first got your super powers, Roxy.

45
00:02:09.249 --> 00:02:11.530
You were just two years old."

46
00:02:12.651 --> 00:02:13.451
Her dad nodded.

47
00:02:13.471 --> 00:02:16.253
"We called you Doodle Bug back then."

48
00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:18.154
Terrell laughed.

49
00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:19.775
"Doodle Bug?"

50
00:02:20.435 --> 00:02:21.416
Roxy turned red.

51
00:02:21.436 --> 00:02:23.317
"I don't remember that."

52
00:02:24.357 --> 00:02:25.298
Her mom shrugged.

53
00:02:25.318 --> 00:02:27.159
"Of course not.

54
00:02:27.539 --> 00:02:29.100
You were really young."

55
00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.221
That night Roxy lay in bed.

56
00:02:36.241 --> 00:02:40.003
"I wonder how I got my super powers."

57
00:02:42.505 --> 00:02:44.726
"I know how you got them," a voice said.

58
00:02:45.847 --> 00:02:46.647
Roxy sat up.

59
00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:47.928
"Who's there?"

60
00:02:48.928 --> 00:02:50.189
She looked around in the dark.

61
00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.711
The room was empty.

62
00:02:52.731 --> 00:02:56.133
"I must be imagining things."

63
00:02:56.913 --> 00:02:57.954
Roxy lay back down.

64
00:02:58.894 --> 00:03:01.156
Soon she fell asleep and forgot about the voice.

65
00:03:06.228 --> 00:03:07.849
In the morning Roxy jumped out of bed.

66
00:03:07.869 --> 00:03:11.632
"Today will be great!"

67
00:03:12.032 --> 00:03:12.513
she thought.

68
00:03:12.533 --> 00:03:17.236
"I'm meeting my friends at Metro City Mall and—" Her watch beeped.

69
00:03:19.738 --> 00:03:21.279
Roxy groaned and then opened it.

70
00:03:21.299 --> 00:03:24.521
"Rocket Girl!"

71
00:03:24.921 --> 00:03:26.222
Mayor Bloom looked nervous.

72
00:03:26.242 --> 00:03:29.324
"Someone is robbing True Savings Bank!"

73
00:03:31.346 --> 00:03:33.307
"Don't worry, Mayor."

74
00:03:33.727 --> 00:03:34.428
Roxy sighed.

75
00:03:35.209 --> 00:03:36.272
"I'm on my way."
